      "content": "The beauty you find in the gloom is a powerful feeling, but that sense of final rest is also a dangerous illusion. While the quiet might feel like grace right now, ending things permanently is an irreversible act, not a beautiful conclusion. If you are wrestling with the idea of fading away, please know there are people who can listen to the poetry of your pain without trying to \"fix\" it. Call or text 988; they are there to sit with you in the darkness.",
